        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liz Rose, Taylor Swift\n- Songs: \"Teardrops on My Guitar\", \"White Horse\", \"You Belong with Me\"\n- Companies: Big Machine Records\n- Albums: Taylor Swift\n- Awards: Grammy Award\n\nFacts:\n- \"Teardrops on My Guitar\" was released on February 19, 2007 by Big Machine Records as the second single from Taylor Swift's eponymous debut album, Taylor Swift (2006).\n- Liz Rose has co-written twenty of Taylor Swift's officially released songs and singles, including \"White Horse\", \"Teardrops on My Guitar\", and \"You Belong with Me\".\n- Liz Rose and Taylor Swift won a Grammy Award in 2010 for \"You Belong with Me\".",
